<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170654953465" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Gawea Ekspresi Luwih Prasaja nganggo Urutan Operasi Itung</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655225397"><term id="term-00015">Nggawe ekspresi luwih prasaja</term> ateges nindakake kabeh petungan sing bisa ditindakake. Tuladhane, kanggo nggawe luwih prasaja <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>, luwih dhisik kita ngepingake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nganti oleh 8, banjur nambahi 1 nganti oleh 9. Biasakna nulis langkah petungan mudhun ing kaca, kanthi saben langkah ana ing ngisor langkah sadurunge. Tuladha sing lagi dijlentrehake bakal katon kaya mangkene:</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170655083428" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170654905788">Kanthi ora nggunakake <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00016">tandha padha karo</term> nalika nggawe ekspresi luwih prasaja, panjenengan bisa nyingkiri kekeliruan antarane ekspresi lan persamaan.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170654905792">
<title>Nggawe Ekspresi Luwih Prasaja</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655107395">Kanggo <emphasis effect="bold">nggawe ekspresi luwih prasaja</emphasis>, tindakna kabeh operasi ing ekspresi kasebut.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655351594">Umume simbol lan notasi sing digunakake ing aljabar wis ditepungake, nanging saiki urutan operasi itung kudu dijlentrehake. Tanpa urutan sing baku, sawijining ekspresi bisa ditegesi kanthi cara sing beda lan ngasilake nilai sing beda. Minangka tuladha, gatekna ekspresi ing ngisor iki:</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170655125718" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170654942450">Yen ekspresi iki digawe luwih prasaja, asil apa sing panjenengan oleh?</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654942453">Sawetara siswa kandha 49,</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170655178023" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mspace width="0.8em"/><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Amarga</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>ngasilake</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mspace width="0.8em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>yaiku</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>49</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mspace width="0.8em"/><m:mn>49</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170654906230">Siswa liyane kandha 25,</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170654906233" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Amarga</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>yaiku</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>21</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>ngasilake</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170655150670">Bayangna kaya apa kacaune sistem perbankan kita yen saben soal nduweni sawetara wangsulan bener sing beda!</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655150674">Ekspresi sing padha kudu ngasilake nilai sing padha. Mula, wiwit biyen para ahli matematika netepake pedoman sing diarani <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00017">urutan operasi itung</term>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170654985585" class="howto">
<title>Tindakna operasi manut urutane.</title>
<list id="fs-id1166422648602" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise">
<item>Tandha Kurung lan Simbol Panglumpukan Liyane
<list id="fs-id1170655082463" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Gawea kabeh ekspresi ing sajrone tandha kurung utawa simbol panglumpukan liyane dadi luwih prasaja, diwiwiti saka tandha kurung paling njero.</item>
</list></item>
<item>Eksponen
<list id="fs-id1170654914692" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Gawea kabeh ekspresi sing ngemot eksponen dadi luwih prasaja.</item>
</list></item>
<item>Ping-pingan lan Paran
<list id="fs-id1170655178958" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Tindakna kabeh ping-pingan lan paran kanthi urut saka kiwa menyang tengen. Loro operasi iki nduweni prioritas sing padha.</item>
</list></item>
<item>Panambahan lan <emphasis effect="bold">Pangurangan</emphasis>
<list id="fs-id1170654943796" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Tindakna kabeh panambahan lan pangurangan kanthi urut saka kiwa menyang tengen. Loro operasi iki nduweni prioritas sing padha.</item>
</list></item>
</list>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1166425080552" class="manipulative-math">Kagiyatan Matematika Manipulatif “Dolanan 24” menehi latihan nggunakake urutan operasi itung.</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654938531">Kanggo ngelingi urutane, klumpukna operasi ing patang tataran prioritas ing ngisor iki. Operasi ing tataran sing padha ditindakake saka kiwa menyang tengen.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170654007218" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">1.</m:mtext><m:mtext> Simbol panglumpukan</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">Prioritas</m:mtext><m:mtext> kapisan</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">2.</m:mtext><m:mtext> Eksponen</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">Prioritas</m:mtext><m:mtext> kapindho</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">3.</m:mtext><m:mtext> Ping-pingan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">lan</m:mtext><m:mtext> paran</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">Prioritas</m:mtext><m:mtext> padha</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">kiwa</m:mtext><m:mtext> menyang tengen</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">4.</m:mtext><m:mtext> Panambahan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">lan</m:mtext><m:mtext> pangurangan</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">Prioritas</m:mtext><m:mtext> padha</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">kiwa</m:mtext><m:mtext> menyang tengen</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170654932101"><emphasis effect="bold">Ping-pingan</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="bold">paran</emphasis> nduweni prioritas sing padha. Kita ora tansah nindakake ping-pingan sadurunge paran utawa paran sadurunge ping-pingan; loro-lorone ditindakake kanthi urut saka <emphasis effect="bold">kiwa</emphasis> menyang <emphasis effect="bold">tengen</emphasis>.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654914381"><emphasis effect="bold">Panambahan</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="bold">pangurangan</emphasis> uga nduweni prioritas sing padha. Loro-lorone ditindakake kanthi urut saka <emphasis effect="bold">kiwa</emphasis> menyang <emphasis effect="bold">tengen</emphasis>.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654928166">Ayo nyoba sawijining tuladha.</para>
<example id="fs-id1170654928169">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654954598">
<problem id="fs-id1170654954600">
<para id="fs-id1170654954602">Gawea luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654939340">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1167836283034"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <newline/>
<table id="fs-id1167833022118" class="unnumbered unstyled can-break" aria-label="Gambar iki nduweni rong kolom, kanthi teks ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ing larik kapisan kolom tengen ana ekspresi 4 ditambah 3 ping 7. Siji larik ing ngisore, teks ing kiwa muni: “Apa ana tandha kurung? Ora. Apa ana eksponen? Ora. Apa ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.” Tetembungan “tandha kurung”, “eksponen”, “ping-pingan”, lan “paran” dicithak kandel kanggo nandhani jinis operasi sing dipriksa. Siji larik ing ngisore, teks ing kiwa muni “Pingake luwih dhisik.” Ing tengen ana maneh ekspresi 4 ditambah 3 ping 7, kanthi 3 ping 7 awarna abang. Siji larik ing ngisore, teks ing kiwa muni “Gunggungen.” Ing tengen ana ekspresi 4 ditambah 21. Ing ngisor ekspresi iki ana 25, yaiku gunggung 4 lan 21."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
    <entry/>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836282522" alt="Ekspresi matematika 4+3•7 ditampilake kanthi teks ireng ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_005a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis effect="bold">tandha kurung</emphasis>? Ora.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis effect="bold">eksponen</emphasis>? Ora.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis effect="bold">ping-pingan</emphasis> utawa <emphasis effect="bold">paran</emphasis>? Ya.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake luwih dhisik.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836477496" alt="Ekspresi matematika '4+3•7' ditampilake ing latar putih. Angka 4 lan tandha tambah awarna ireng, dene angka 3, titik ping-pingan, lan angka 7 awarna abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_005b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gunggungen.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167833397265" alt="Gambar nuduhake ekspresi matematika prasaja '4+21' kanthi tulisan ireng ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_005c_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry/>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836477509" alt="Angka 25 ditampilake kanthi tulisan klawu peteng ing latar putih polos."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_005d_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</para>
<para id="fs-id1167836522115"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <newline/>
<table id="fs-id1167829713618" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar iki nduweni rong kolom tanpa irah-irahan kolom: teks ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ana enem larik. Larik kapisan: kiwa kosong; tengen bukak kurung biasa, 4 ditambah 3, tutup kurung biasa, ping 7. Larik kapindho: kiwa “Apa ana tandha kurung? Ya.”; tengen ekspresi sing padha, bukak kurung biasa, 4 ditambah 3, tutup kurung biasa, ping 7. Larik katelu: kiwa “Gawea bagean ing sajrone tandha kurung luwih prasaja.”; tengen bukak kurung biasa, 7, tutup kurung biasa, ping 7. Ping-pingan ing larik iki dituduhake kanthi jejeran, tanpa titik sing dicithak. Larik kapapat: kiwa “Apa ana eksponen? Ora.”; tengen kosong. Larik kalima: kiwa “Apa ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.”; tengen kosong. Larik kapenem: kiwa “Pingake.”; tengen 49. Tetembungan jinis operasi ing pitakon dicithak kandel. Wacan iki nerangake petungan tanpa gumantung warna."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
    <entry/>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836700561" alt="Ekspresi matematika nuduhake gunggung 4 lan 3 ing sajrone tandha kurung sing dipingake karo 7. Ekspresine ditulis minangka (4 + 3)·7."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_006a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis effect="bold">tandha kurung</emphasis>? Ya.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167824617198" alt="Ekspresi matematika nuduhake (4+3) dipingake karo 7. Kabeh bagean (4+3), kalebu tandha kurung lan tandha tambah, awarna abang; titik ping-pingan lan angka 7 awarna peteng."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_006b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gawea bagean ing sajrone tandha kurung luwih prasaja.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836329648" alt="Ekspresi (7)7 ditampilake tanpa titik ping-pingan. Angka 7 kapisan ana ing sajrone tandha kurung lan awarna abang; tandha kurung lan angka 7 kapindho awarna peteng. Jejeran (7) lan 7 nuduhake ping-pingan."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_006c_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis effect="bold">eksponen</emphasis>? Ora.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis effect="bold">ping-pingan</emphasis> utawa <emphasis effect="bold">paran</emphasis>? Ya.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167829808043" alt="Angka '49' ditampilake kanthi cetha ing latar putih polos, nganggo tulisan klawu peteng utawa ireng sing rada burem."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_006d_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170654944310" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654936731">
<problem id="fs-id1170654936733">
<para id="fs-id1170654936735">Gawea luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654942949">
<para id="fs-id1170654942951"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 2 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 14</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654941665" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655164725">
<problem id="fs-id1170655164727">
<para id="fs-id1170655164730">Gawea luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655213403">
<para id="fs-id1170654966589"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 35 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 99</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1170654942986">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654942988">
<problem id="fs-id1170654942990">
<para id="fs-id1170654944773">Gawea luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655114295">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="fs-id1167836375645" class="unnumbered unstyled can-break" aria-label="Gambar iki nduweni rong kolom tanpa irah-irahan kolom: teks ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ana wolung larik. Larik kapisan: kiwa “Tandha kurung? Ya, kurangana luwih dhisik.”; tengen 18 dipara 6 ditambah 4 ping bukak kurung biasa, 5 dikurangi 2, tutup kurung biasa. Ing ngisore ing sel sing padha ana 18 dipara 6 ditambah 4 ping bukak kurung biasa, 3, tutup kurung biasa. Larik kapindho: kiwa “Eksponen? Ora.”; tengen kosong. Larik katelu: kiwa “Ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.”; tengen 18 dipara 6 ditambah 4 ping bukak kurung biasa, 3, tutup kurung biasa. Larik kapapat: kiwa “Para luwih dhisik amarga ping-pingan lan paran ditindakake saka kiwa menyang tengen.”; tengen 3 ditambah 4 ping bukak kurung biasa, 3, tutup kurung biasa. Larik kalima: kiwa “Isih ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.”; tengen kosong. Larik kapenem: kiwa “Pingake.”; tengen 3 ditambah 12. Larik kapitu: kiwa “Isih ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ora.”; tengen kosong. Larik kawolu: kiwa “Ana panambahan utawa pangurangan? Ya.”; tengen 15. Jejeran wilangan lan kurung nuduhake ping-pingan. Wacan iki nerangake petungan tanpa gumantung warna."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
    <entry align="left" valign="top">Tandha kurung? Ya, kurangana luwih dhisik.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math><newline/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em"/></m:mrow></m:math><media id="fs-id1167836598935" alt="Ekspresi matematika nuduhake 18 dipara 6, ditambah 4 dipingake karo 3, yaiku 18 ÷ 6 + 4(3)."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_007b_img.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Eksponen? Ora.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1171791418206" alt="Ekspresi matematika 18 ÷ 6 + 4(3) ditampilake ing latar putih kanggo meragakake urutan operasi itung. Bagean paran lan ping-pingan awarna abang, dene tandha tambah ing antarane awarna peteng."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_007f_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Para luwih dhisik amarga ping-pingan lan paran ditindakake saka kiwa menyang tengen.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167833349691" alt="Ekspresi matematika '3 + 4(3)' ditampilake kanthi bagean '4(3)' dicethakake nganggo warna abang, sing nuduhake yen ping-pingan ditindakake sadurunge panambahan manut urutan operasi itung."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_007c_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Isih ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836622811" alt="Ekspresi matematika prasaja '3 + 12' ditampilake kanthi tulisan peteng sing cetha ing latar putih minangka soal panambahan."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_007d_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Isih ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ora.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Ana panambahan utawa pangurangan? Ya.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167829596718" alt="Angka '15' ditampilake kanthi warna klawu peteng ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_007e_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655128975" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655117790">
<problem id="fs-id1170655117792">
<para id="fs-id1170655117794">Gawea luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>30</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654943705">
<para id="fs-id1170654936134">16</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654928200" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654928204">
<problem id="fs-id1170655232374">
<para id="fs-id1170655232376">Gawea luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655288151">
<para id="fs-id1170655288153">23</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654928809">Yen ana sawetara simbol panglumpukan, kita nggawe bagean ing tandha kurung paling njero luwih prasaja dhisik, banjur maju menyang njaba.</para>
<example id="fs-id1170655174684">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655174686">
<problem id="fs-id1170655228886">
<para id="fs-id1170655228888">Gawea luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654914329">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="fs-id1167829840981" class="unnumbered unstyled can-break" aria-label="Gambar iki nduweni rong kolom tanpa irah-irahan kolom: teks ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ana patbelas larik. Larik kapisan: kiwa kosong; tengen 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 6 dikurangi 3 ping bukak kurung biasa, 4 dikurangi 2, tutup kurung biasa, tutup kurung siku. Larik kapindho: kiwa “Apa ana tandha kurung (utawa simbol panglumpukan liyane)? Ya.”; tengen kosong. Larik katelu: kiwa “Gatekna tandha kurung biasa ing sajrone tandha kurung siku.”; tengen ekspresi wiwitan diulang: 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 6 dikurangi 3 ping bukak kurung biasa, 4 dikurangi 2, tutup kurung biasa, tutup kurung siku. Larik kapapat: kiwa “Kurangana.”; tengen 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 6 dikurangi 3 ping bukak kurung biasa, 2, tutup kurung biasa, tutup kurung siku. Larik kalima: kiwa “Terusna ing sajrone tandha kurung siku lan pingake.”; tengen 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 6 dikurangi 6, tutup kurung siku. Larik kapenem: kiwa “Terusna ing sajrone tandha kurung siku lan kurangana.”; tengen 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 0, tutup kurung siku. Larik kapitu: kiwa “Ekspresi ing sajrone tandha kurung siku ora perlu digawe luwih prasaja maneh.”; tengen kosong. Larik kawolu: kiwa “Apa ana eksponen? Ya.”; tengen 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 0, tutup kurung siku. Larik kasanga: kiwa “Gawea ekspresi pangkat luwih prasaja.”; tengen 5 ditambah 8 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 0, tutup kurung siku. Larik kasepuluh: kiwa “Apa ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.”; tengen kosong. Larik kasewelas: kiwa “Pingake.”; tengen 5 ditambah 8 ditambah 0. Larik karolas: kiwa “Apa ana panambahan utawa pangurangan? Ya.”; tengen kosong. Larik katelulas: kiwa “Gunggungen.”; tengen 13 ditambah 0. Larik kapatbelas: kiwa “Gunggungen.”; tengen 13. Jejeran wilangan lan kurung nuduhake ping-pingan. Wacan iki nerangake petungan tanpa gumantung warna."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
    <entry/>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836287043" alt="Ditampilake ekspresi matematika kanthi wilangan lan operasi panambahan, pangurangan, pangkat, lan ping-pingan sing ditata nganggo tandha kurung biasa lan siku: 5 + 2^3 + 3[6 - 3(4 - 2)]."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana tandha kurung (utawa simbol panglumpukan liyane)? Ya.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gatekna tandha kurung biasa ing sajrone tandha kurung siku.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836326514" alt="Soal matematika nuduhake ekspresi aritmetika 5 + 2^3 + 3[6 - 3(4 - 2)]. Pangurangan ing tandha kurung paling njero, '4 - 2', dicethakake nganggo warna abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kurangana.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836578693" alt="Ekspresi matematika muni 5 + 2^3 + 3[6 - 3(2)]. Bagean '3(2)' dicethakake nganggo warna abang kanggo nuduhake langkah sing lagi ditindakake."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008c_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Terusna ing sajrone tandha kurung siku lan pingake.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167833142573" alt="Ekspresi matematika nuduhake 5 ditambah 2 kubik ditambah 3 dipingake karo besaran 6 dikurangi 6, kanthi angka 6 kapindho dicethakake nganggo warna abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008d_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Terusna ing sajrone tandha kurung siku lan kurangana.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167824720931" alt="Ekspresi matematika nuduhake '5 + 2^3 + 3[0]'. Angka 0 ing sajrone tandha kurung siku dicethakake nganggo warna abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008e_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Ekspresi ing sajrone tandha kurung siku ora perlu digawe luwih prasaja maneh.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana eksponen? Ya.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836571320" alt="Ekspresi matematika nuduhake 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3, ditambah 3 dipingake karo 0."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008f_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gawea ekspresi pangkat luwih prasaja.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836363366" alt="Ekspresi matematika '5 + 8 + 3[0]' ditampilake ing latar putih, kanthi bagean '3[0]' dicethakake nganggo warna abang kanggo nuduhake bagean sing lagi ditindakake."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008g_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836628989" alt="Gambar nuduhake ekspresi matematika 5+8+0. Angka 5 lan 8 sarta tandha tambah kapisan awarna abang, dene tandha tambah kapindho lan angka 0 awarna ireng."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008h_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana panambahan utawa pangurangan? Ya.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gunggungen.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836408301" alt="Ekspresi matematika '13 + 0' ditampilake kanthi tulisan abang sing rada burem ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008i_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gunggungen.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836321064" alt="13"><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008j_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655222643" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655222647">
<problem id="fs-id1170654924513">
<para id="fs-id1170654924515">Gawea luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655201328">
<para id="fs-id1170655201331">86</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654936028" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654942628">
<problem id="fs-id1170654942630">
<para id="fs-id1170654942632">Gawea luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655163264">
<para id="fs-id1170654940244">1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>